{"id":"8be923caff92504f","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-creative.md","title":"Creative Set","display":"df-creative — Creative Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-creative","aliases":["57-df-creative"],"display":"df-creative — Creative Set","depends_on":["[[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]","[[57-df-W-e]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-creative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-creative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-creative — Creative Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9f2c37860ff19d3b\" href=\"?note=9f2c37860ff19d3b\" title=\"57-df-recursively-enumerable\">57-df-recursively-enumerable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b1118344012e3e87\" href=\"?note=b1118344012e3e87\" title=\"57-df-W-e\">57-df-W-e</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Creative-Set\">Creative Set</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b1118344012e3e87\" href=\"?note=b1118344012e3e87\" title=\"57-df-W-e\">57-df-W-e</a> 的同一自然数编号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f2c37860ff19d3b\" href=\"?note=9f2c37860ff19d3b\" title=\"57-df-recursively-enumerable\">57-df-recursively-enumerable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative}\\)</span> 保留原定义中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\\subseteq A\">\\(W_e\\subseteq A\\)</span> 条件；不将它替换为补集上的生产函数条件或真包含。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 是下式的相关编号集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:e\\in W_e\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:e\\in W_e\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}creative}\\vdash A\\in\\mathrm{Creative}\\leftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e\\subseteq A\\to\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\in A\\setminus W_e)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}creative}\\vdash A\\in\\mathrm{Creative}\\leftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e\\subseteq A\\to\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\in A\\setminus W_e)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原谓词的数学对象。按本册 RE 的定义，任一 A∈RE 都等于某个 Wₑ，代入该 e 后所要求的差集为空，因此这个 Creative 类为空；它不是通常递归论中的创造性集类。该事实不是对定义的修订条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Creative-Set","text":"Creative Set","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-recursively-enumerable","status":"resolved","id":"9f2c37860ff19d3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-W-e","status":"resolved","id":"b1118344012e3e87","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-W-e]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-W-e","status":"resolved","id":"b1118344012e3e87","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$W_e$ 取 [[57-df-W-e]] 的同一自然数编号，$\\mathrm{RE}$ 取 [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]。$\\mathrm{Creative}$ 保留原定义中的 $W_e\\subseteq A$ 条件；不将它替换为补集上的生产函数条件或真包含。$K$ 是下式的相关编号集合。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-recursively-enumerable","status":"resolved","id":"9f2c37860ff19d3b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$W_e$ 取 [[57-df-W-e]] 的同一自然数编号，$\\mathrm{RE}$ 取 [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]。$\\mathrm{Creative}$ 保留原定义中的 $W_e\\subseteq A$ 条件；不将它替换为补集上的生产函数条件或真包含。$K$ 是下式的相关编号集合。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative}","display":false},{"tex":"W_e\\subseteq A","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:e\\in W_e\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}creative}\\vdash A\\in\\mathrm{Creative}\\leftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e\\subseteq A\\to\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\in A\\setminus W_e)).","display":true}],"bytes":1096,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57-df-